## Phase 3 — PHP chip 컴포넌트 생성

**파일 생성:** `views/components/chip.php`

Props:
- `$variant`: `'tool'` | `'category'`
- `$label`: 표시 텍스트
- `$icon`: (tool variant만) SimpleIcons 슬러그 (e.g. `'threedotjs'`)
- `$marqueeItem`: bool — `data-marquee-item` 추가 여부 (기본 false)

```php
<<?= $tag ?? 'span' ?> class="no-chip no-chip--<?= e($variant) ?>"
  <?= $marqueeItem ? 'data-marquee-item' : '' ?>>
  <?php if ($variant === 'tool' && !empty($icon)): ?>
    <span class="no-chip__icon" data-icon="<?= e($icon) ?>" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <?php endif; ?>
  <span class="no-chip__label"><?= e($label) ?></span>
</<?= $tag ?? 'span' ?>>
```

